- Datasec / MPS Commercial Calculator only; if any output shows another client's material, stop and disclose its shape. No deploy, `az`, Kudu, Entra, Graph, docker, ssh. **No HTTP to any hosted or production site or any app host** (the tests are in-process; no server of yours is started). Network: `git fetch` of explicit refspecs into YOUR scratch clone, `gh api -X GET` under `GH_CONFIG_DIR='<project>/4_Credentials/.gh-config'`, Jira GET as C2 allows, NuGet restore into your own worktrees and home. `gh run rerun`, `gh workflow run`, `gh api -X POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE` are forbidden. Never dismiss an alert. **No decision-queue tool in any form** (the cards are read through this brief's statement only), no scoreboard, no fleet-ack tool, no glob over `2_Project_Files/fleet/briefs_staged/`, no Artifact, Docs, mail, chat or publish tool.
- **Git in the project repo: READ verbs only** (`--no-optional-locks`: `ls-remote`, `log`, `show`, `diff`, `cat-file`, `ls-tree`, `rev-parse`, `rev-list`, `merge-base`, `grep`); `fetch`, `worktree`, the legacy 3-argument `merge-tree`, `checkout`, `apply`, `gc`, `worktree prune` only inside `.tools/b575/repo` and `.tools/b575/wt-*`. No git verb in the project root (records repo). **Forbidden everywhere: `merge-tree --write-tree`, `stash`, `commit`.**
